---
import tucan from "../../assets/paissana/tucan.svg";

// Sección 7 · Mockup: documentacion/seccion7@2x-100.jpg
// "Productores PaisSana": encabezado con la ilustración del tucán a la derecha y
// listado de historias audiovisuales (crónicas). Cada fila lleva thumbnail 16:9
// a la izquierda con botón de play, título, subtítulo y descripción.
---

<section class="productores-videos">
  <div class="productores-header-grid">
    <div class="productores-header-text">
      <h2>PRODUCTORES PAISSANA:</h2>
      <h3>Historias que transforman: el rostro de la paz</h3>
      <p>Detrás de cada producto con el sello PaisSana hay hombres y mujeres valientes que creyeron en el poder de la legalidad, el trabajo asociativo y el desarrollo sostenible. <strong>A través de estas crónicas audiovisuales y contenidos, conoce a los verdaderos protagonistas de PaisSana:</strong> historias inspiradoras que demuestran cómo la producción local construye una Colombia que sana y avanza.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="productores-header-tucan">
      <img src={tucan.src} alt="Tucán" width="200" height="300" class="tucan-img" />
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="videos-list">
    <!-- Video 1 -->
    <article class="video-row-card">
      <div class="video-thumb">
        <img src="https://placehold.co/600x350?text=Cronica+1" alt="Crónica #1" width="600" height="350" class="thumb-img" />
        <button class="play-btn-large" aria-label="Reproducir Crónica #1">
          <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="var(--color-nav-text, #32509d)" stroke="none">
            <polygon points="5 3 19 12 5 21 5 3"></polygon>
          </svg>
        </button>
      </div>
      <div class="video-info">
        <h3>Crónica #1</h3>
        <p class="video-subtitle">Crónica</p>
        <p class="video-desc">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetuer adipiscing elit, sed diam nonummy nibh euismod tincidunt ut laoreet dolore magna aliquam erat.</p>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- Video 2 -->
    <article class="video-row-card">
      <div class="video-thumb">
        <img src="https://placehold.co/600x350?text=Cronica+2" alt="Crónica #2" width="600" height="350" class="thumb-img" />
        <button class="play-btn-large" aria-label="Reproducir Crónica #2">
          <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="var(--color-nav-text, #32509d)" stroke="none">
            <polygon points="5 3 19 12 5 21 5 3"></polygon>
          </svg>
        </button>
      </div>
      <div class="video-info">
        <h3>Crónica #2</h3>
        <p class="video-subtitle">Crónicaz</p>
        <p class="video-desc">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetuer adipiscing elit, sed diam nonummy nibh euismod tincidunt ut laoreet dolore magna aliquam erat.</p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  /* =========================================
     CSS GENERAL
     ========================================= */
  .productores-videos {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-8, 2rem);
    width: 100%;
  }

  /* HEADER TEXT & TUCAN */
  .productores-header-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-6, 1.5rem);
    align-items: center;
  }

  .productores-header-text h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-komet);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-komet-heavy, 800);
    color: var(--color-nav-text, #32509d);
  }

  .productores-header-text h3 {
    margin-top: var(--space-2, 0.5rem);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4, 1rem);
    font-family: var(--font-komet);
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-komet-regular, 400);
    color: var(--color-nav-text, #32509d);
  }

  .productores-header-text p {
    font-family: var(--font-komet);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-komet-light, 300);
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-nav-text, #32509d);
  }

  .productores-header-text strong {
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-komet-heavy, 800);
  }

  .productores-header-tucan {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .tucan-img {
    max-width: 200px;
    height: auto;
    object-fit: contain;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 10px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1));
    transition: transform 0.4s ease;
  }

  .tucan-img:hover {
    transform: rotate(-3deg) scale(1.05);
  }

  /* VIDEOS LIST */
  .videos-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-6, 1.5rem);
    margin-top: var(--space-4, 1rem);
  }

  /* VIDEO ROW CARD */
  .video-row-card {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-6, 1.5rem);
    background-color: transparent;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-nav-text, #32509d);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-nav-text, #32509d);
    border-left: none;
    border-right: none;
    padding-block: var(--space-6, 1.5rem);
    padding-inline: 0;
  }

  /* THUMBNAIL */
  .video-thumb {
    position: relative;
    border-radius: 6px;
    overflow: hidden;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
    width: 100%;
    order: 1;
  }

  .thumb-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    transition: transform 0.5s ease;
  }

  .video-row-card:hover .thumb-img {
    transform: scale(1.02);
  }

  .play-btn-large {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    width: 68px;
    height: 68px;
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
    border: none;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    cursor: pointer;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .play-btn-large:hover {
    background-color: #ffffff;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(1.1);
  }

  /* VIDEO INFO */
  .video-info {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-2, 0.5rem);
    justify-content: center;
    color: var(--color-nav-text, #32509d);
    font-family: var(--font-komet);
    order: 2;
  }

  .video-info h3 {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-komet);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-komet-heavy, 800);
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    color: var(--color-nav-text, #32509d);
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .video-subtitle {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-komet);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-komet-light, 300);
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--color-nav-text, #32509d);
    opacity: 0.9;
  }

  .video-desc {
    margin: 0;
    margin-top: var(--space-3, 0.75rem);
    font-family: var(--font-komet);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-komet-light, 300);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--color-nav-text, #32509d);
  }

  /* =========================================
     BREAKPOINT 850px
     ========================================= */
  @media (min-width: 850px) {
    .productores-header-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 3fr 1fr;
    }

    .video-row-card {
      grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr;
      align-items: center;
      padding-block: var(--space-8, 2rem);
    }

    .video-thumb {
      order: 1;
    }

    .video-info {
      order: 2;
    }
  }

  /* =========================================
     BREAKPOINT 360px
     ========================================= */
</style>
